title: Palo Alto Networks: VPN IKE gateways (phase 1)
agents: paloalto_api
catalog: hw/network/paloalto
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-paloalto-api
description:
 Monitors the IKE gateways ("show vpn gateway") of a firewall. The service is
 OK if an IKE security association exists for the gateway ("show vpn ike-sa")
 and CRIT (configurable) otherwise. On the passive member of an HA pair no
 IKE SAs exist; the service is OK there by default.

item:
 The name of the IKE gateway.

discovery:
 One service is created per configured IKE gateway.
